<!--
   Defintion for a Table of Properties
   A table can have any number of Column, each defined by an
   included TableProperty.
   The number of rows in the table is defined by nRows.
   If nRows is set to "dynamic" then the number of rows in this table is
   dynamically defined by the user of this descriptor.
   Add definition of minNumRows, maxNumRows
   We could have defaultvalue for each cell
   -->
